{{ENExclusive}}
'''Shakurel Gory''' is an enemy that appears in the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]] and the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shakurel Gory
|image = E 471.png
|first appearance = [[Gnawin' Bones]]
|latest appearance = [[The Future Is Chins]]
|money drop = 550¢ - 2,172¢
}}

==Enemy==
The Shakurel variant of [[Gory]]. About as easy as one, requiring barely anything to defeat.

==Strategy==
Treat this enemy as you would a [[Gory]], [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] can be very helpful at defeating it.

